{"story":{"id":"site-mutation-vats","title":{"zh":"异变化石","en":"Mutant Fossils"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/b1017c6265487cb39e3c.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:mutation_vats","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们在这颗星球上发现了有着令人惊异数量的严重异变化石，它们都属于同一种已灭绝的智慧物种。\n\n究竟是什么导致了一个高等社会数百万成员的异变？我们的考古学家想进一步调查。","en":"A surprising number of heavily-mutated fossils has been found on this planet, all belonging to the same species of extinct sapients.\n\nWhat could have led to the mutation of millions of members of a once-advanced society? Our archaeologists would like to invest"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:mutation_vats","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.2045","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1735"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.2046","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.2047","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:mutation_vats","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"异变化石","en":"Mutant Fossils"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们在这颗星球上发现了有着令人惊异数量的严重异变化石，它们都属于同一种已灭绝的智慧物种。\n\n究竟是什么导致了一个高等社会数百万成员的异变？我们的考古学家想进一步调查。","en":"A surprising number of heavily-mutated fossils has been found on this planet, all belonging to the same species of extinct sapients.\n\nWhat could have led to the mutation of millions of members of a once-advanced society? Our archaeologists would like to investigate further."}],"sections":[{"zh":"我们在这颗星球上发现了有着令人惊异数量的严重异变化石，它们都属于同一种已灭绝的智慧物种。\n\n究竟是什么导致了一个高等社会数百万成员的异变？我们的考古学家想进一步调查。","en":"A surprising number of heavily-mutated fossils h